    "historicalInfo": "Dazaifu Tenmangu was established in 905 AD to enshrine the spirit of scholar-statesman Sugawara no Michizane who died in exile in Dazaifu in 903. The shrine is the headquarters of approximately 12,000 Tenmangu shrines throughout Japan.",
    "yearBuilt": null,
