    "id": "seoul_북촌한옥마을_전통_차_체험_bukchon_hanok_v",
    "cityId": "seoul",
    "name": "북촌한옥마을 & 전통 차 체험 (Bukchon Hanok Village & Traditional Tea Ceremony)",
