        "narration": "Welcome to Keelung Miaokou Night Market, one of Taiwan's most celebrated street food destinations! Operating in front of the ancient Dianzai Temple just minutes from the cruise port, this sprawling market of 200+ stalls specializes in Keelung's unique port-city seafood dishes: fresh oyster omelets, shrimp ball soup, sour fish ball broth, and silky tofu desserts you won't find anywhere else in Taiwan. By evening the streets are electric with sizzling woks, calling vendors, and the irresistible aromas of Taiwan's finest street cuisine.",
