    "historicalInfo": "Before the cable car opened in 1979, the only ways to reach the port from Fira were by walking or riding donkeys down the 587 steep steps cut into the cliff. The cable car was a transformative addition for both locals and the growing tourism industry.",
    "yearBuilt": null,
