        "narration": "Raise a glass at the Bonanza Bar & Grill, right in the heart of Skagway's Gold Rush historic district. Surrounded by original 1890s architecture, vintage mining photos, and the spirit of Alaska's frontier past, enjoy craft beers and hearty frontier fare — reindeer sausage, grilled Alaska salmon, and halibut fish tacos. This is where Skagway's Gold Rush story comes deliciously alive.",
        "description": "A Gold Rush-themed bar and grill in an 1890s building on Skagway's historic Broadway Street."
