    "narration": "Explore the Stedelijk Museum's world-class collection of modern and contemporary art, from Mondrian and Matisse to Basquiat and Marlene Dumas. Its distinctive bathtub extension is an Amsterdam landmark in itself.",
    "description": "World-class modern art museum with Mondrian, Matisse and contemporary works",
    "category": "Museum",
    "detailedDescription": "The Stedelijk houses one of Europe's finest collections of modern and contemporary art and design. The permanent collection includes key works by Mondrian, Malevich, Kandinsky, Cézanne, and Picasso alongside outstanding Dutch and international contemporary artists. The striking white bathtub extension (2012) by Benthem Crouwel contrasts beautifully with the original 1895 building. The Design collection is equally impressive.",
