    "historicalInfo": "Named after Thomas Corwin Mendenhall, a geodesist with the U.S. Coast and Geodetic Survey. The glacier has retreated significantly since measurements began in the 1940s due to climate change.",
    "yearBuilt": null,
    "architect": null,
