    "historicalInfo": "Keelung has been Taiwan's premier fishing port since the Japanese colonial era. The Kanzaiding Fish Market (崁仔頂漁市) near the harbor has operated pre-dawn fresh fish auctions for over a century, supplying the city's renowned seafood restaurants.",
    "yearBuilt": null,
