    "historicalInfo": "Ludwig's Bistro has been a Sitka culinary landmark for over two decades, pioneering the concept of Mediterranean-Alaska fusion cuisine. It has helped put Sitka on the culinary map, demonstrating that Alaska's remote ports can offer world-class fine dining experiences.",
