    "historicalInfo": "The Star Ferry Company was founded in 1888 by Dorabjee Naorojee Mithaiwala, an Indian Parsee businessman. The service has crossed Victoria Harbour continuously for over 136 years and was named by TIME magazine as one of the world's most romantic travel experiences.",
