        "narration": "Welcome aboard the Star Ferry, Hong Kong's most beloved icon and one of the world's great travel experiences! These distinctive green-and-white double-decked vessels have crossed Victoria Harbour since 1888, and the 8-minute journey between Central and Tsim Sha Tsui remains the finest way to appreciate Hong Kong's incomparable skyline. For a fare of just HK$3.70—less than a dollar—you ride a living piece of history while the world's most dramatic city panorama unfolds around you. TIME magazine called it one of the world's most romantic travel experiences. We agree.",
