    "historicalInfo": "Santorini's winemaking tradition spans over 3,500 years. The island's indigenous Assyrtiko grape and the ancient kouloura vine-training method — recognized as UNESCO Intangible Heritage — produce wines uniquely shaped by the volcanic terroir.",
    "yearBuilt": null,
